54828599034).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=176043351","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-10-03 23:15:34","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Bom Sucesso Trade Center, Porto, Portugal (54828599034)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2|October 2025 in Porto|Shopping Cidade do Porto","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"The Bom Sucesso Trade Center in Porto is a striking landmark of late-20th-century Portuguese architecture, blending monumental stone with reflective blue glass. Its bold geometric forms, including angular cutouts and stacked towers, give the building a dramatic rhythm against the skyline. The façade mirrors the sky and clouds, constantly shifting with the light, while the solid stone base conveys weight and permanence. Located near the historic Mercado do Bom Sucesso, the Trade Center houses offices, shops, and hospitality spaces, serving as a hub of modern urban life. It symbolizes Porto’s balance between commerce, innovation, and architectural ambition.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2025-10-02 17:18","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/dalecruse/54828599034/\">Bom Sucesso Trade Center, Porto, Portugal</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/91873384@N04\">Dale Cruse - 10M views</a> from San Francisco, CA, USA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequir